  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Part (i)",
   "text": "**Review Q6 (i) log₉ x = 0.5**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\log_{9} x=0.5\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Exponential form: }x=9^{0.5}\\\\[5pt]&0.5=\\frac{1}{2},\\text{ so }9^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{9}=3\\\\[5pt]&x=3\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Check: }\\log_{9} 3=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{ because }9^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\\\[5pt]&\\quad 3\\;\\checkmark \\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 0
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Part (ii)",
   "text": "**Review Q6 (ii) (1/9)^(3x) = 27**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&(\\frac{1}{9})^{3x}=27\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Write both with base }3:\\frac{1}{9}=3^{-2}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{and }27=3^{3}\\\\[5pt]&(3^{-2})^{3x}=3^{3}\\\\[5pt]&3^{-6x}=3^{3}\\quad \\text{[(-2) $\\times$ 3x = -6x]}\\\\[5pt]&-6x=3\\\\[5pt]&x=\\frac{3}{-6}\\\\[5pt]&x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Check: }(\\frac{1}{9})^{-\\frac{3}{2}}=9^{\\frac{3}{2}}=(\\sqrt{9})^{3}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad =27\\;\\checkmark \\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 1
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Part (iii)",
   "text": "**Review Q6 (iii) (1/32)^(2x) = 64**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&(\\frac{1}{32})^{2x}=64\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Write both with base }2:\\frac{1}{32}=2^{-5}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{and }64=2^{6}\\\\[5pt]&(2^{-5})^{2x}=2^{6}\\\\[5pt]&2^{-10x}=2^{6}\\quad \\text{[(-5) $\\times$ 2x = -10x]}\\\\[5pt]&-10x=6\\\\[5pt]&x=\\frac{6}{-10}\\\\[5pt]&x=-\\frac{3}{5}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Check: }(\\frac{1}{32})^{-\\frac{6}{5}}=32^{\\frac{6}{5}}=\\\\[5pt]&\\quad (2^{5})^{\\frac{6}{5}}=2^{6}=64\\;\\checkmark \\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
